        {num, select,
          0 {The Salesforce Marketing Cloud v2 integration is only available for Growth and Enterprise customers (allows on-demand sync only).}
          1 {To schedule daily and hourly syncs, you need at least an Amplitude Plus Plan.}
          2 {Anonymized UUIDs are used as identifiers in both Amplitude and Salesforce Marketing Cloud for this integration, so you do not have to send email addresses or PII to Amplitude.}
        }
      }
      segment {
        {num, select,
          0 {To configure this integration, you need a level of access that allows you to configure sources in Segment and integrations in Amplitude. For Amplitude users, this means you need Admin or Manager privileges.}
          1 {This integration sends user_id values from behavioral cohorts to Segment, along with an attribute that flags the cohort each user belongs to.}
          2 {Anonymous users are not supported.}
          3 {You can sync behavioral cohorts to your Segment-connected raw data warehouses and downstream destinations that accept Segment identify events. Amplitude sets cohorts as unique user traits in Segment with True/False values to reflect whether the given user belongs to the synced cohort.}
        }
      }
