        {num, select,
          0 {You need a Snapchat Ads Manager account with permission to create audiences.}
          1 {A Snapchat Ads Account has a limit of 1000 Customer List segments (unique cohorts).}
          2 {To use this integration, you must have an Amplitude user property that maps to a Snapchat Ads Key. Snapchat Ads supports these keys: (Email, Phone Number, Mobile Ad ID).}
          3 {Snapchat Ads requires SHA256 encryption. If your Amplitude key is not encrypted, Amplitude applies SHA256 when syncing cohort data.}
          4 {Snapchat Ads requires users to have the associated keys (Email, Phone Number, or Mobile Ad ID) beforehand. In cases where users do not have the associated keys, they are not synced to Snapchat Ads. This can cause a discrepancy between the number of users in Snapchat Ads and Amplitude.}
          5 {After you have chosen a target key to sync to Snapchat Ads, there is no way to change it unless you disconnect and reconnect to Snapchat Ads. This is because Snapchat Ads uses OAuth and cannot support updating a cohort (audience) with two different keys.}
        }
      }
      split {
        {num, select,
          0 {This integration is only available for customers who have paid plans with Amplitude.}
          1 {The Split integration supports ingestion of cohorts with fewer than 100,000 users.}
          2 {You must ensure that the identifier in Amplitude and Split matches. This is often userID. If they do not match, the integration will not work.}
        }
      }
      statsig {
        {num, select,
          0 {This integration is only available for customers who have paid plans with Amplitude.}
          1 {After your cohort is synced into Statsig, you can find it under Segments in the Statsig console. Expect updates to reflect within 15 minutes.}
        }
      }
      tiktok_ads {
        {num, select,
          0 {You need a TikTok for Business account.}
          1 {To use this integration, you must have an Amplitude user property that maps to a TikTok key. TikTok supports Apple Ads ID (IDFA), Google Ads ID (GAID), email, and phone number.}
          2 {This integration must be enabled on a per-project basis.}
          3 {TikTok Ads requires SHA256 encryption. If your Amplitude key is not encrypted, Amplitude applies SHA256 when syncing cohort data.}
          4 {You cannot change the TikTok key after you save the integration. If you need to use a different key, disconnect the integration in Amplitude and set it up again.}
        }
      }
    }

