cohorts.howItWorks:
{connectionName, select,
    urban_airship {This integration combines Amplitude's analytics with Airship's customer engagement tools into one unified system. Use this integration to interact with any user segment or cohort via push notifications, in-app messages, and more to enhance your app engagement or conversion goals.}
    s3_cohort {Set up this integration to send cohorts to an Amazon S3 bucket. This enables you to export groups of users out of Amplitude and synchronize them with other databases or stored procedures you have built off your Amazon S3 bucket. From there, you can use Amplitude cohorts in internal analytics dashboards and internal personalization engines.}
    appcues {Amplitude's Appcues integration allows you to send finely targeted behavioral audiences from Amplitude to Appcues. You can then use them to power tailored in-product onboarding tutorials, tooltips, announcements, promotions, and surveys.}
    appsflyer {By sending Amplitude cohorts to AppsFlyer Audiences, you can leverage your first-party Amplitude data to create rich audiences that power performance and organic marketing initiatives at scale.}
    appboy {Amplitude's Braze integration lets you send your Amplitude cohorts straight to Braze with just a few clicks.}
    braze {Amplitude's Braze integration lets you send your Amplitude cohorts straight to Braze with just a few clicks.}
    customer_io {Customer.io offers a two-way sync with Amplitude that allows you to easily map your customer behavioral data to create highly personalized automated messages, campaigns, and user journeys.}
    facebook {This integration enables you to create custom audiences from your first-party behavioral data to drive new user acquisition and conversions.}
    google_ads {With this integration, you can upload and sync behavioral cohorts directly to the Google ad network.}
    hubspot {The HubSpot destination allows you to sync your Amplitude-built cohort to your HubSpot contacts lists for targeting purposes.}
    infobip {This integration lets you sync cohorts from Amplitude to Infobip's omnichannel engagement platform.}
    insider {Partners can extend their segmentation and personalization capabilities that Insider offers with this cohort integration with Amplitude.}
    intercom {Send Amplitude cohorts to Intercom Conversational Relationship Platform.}
    iterable {Send Amplitude cohorts to Iterable to use them in your customer engagement efforts.}
    klaviyo {This integration lets you sync cohorts from Amplitude to Klaviyo's email marketing platform.}
    launchdarkly {This integration lets you sync cohorts from Amplitude to LaunchDarkly's feature management platform.}
    leanplum {Leanplum helps mobile teams orchestrate multi-channel campaigns from messaging to the in-app experience, all from a single mobile marketing platform.}
    mailchimp {This integration enables you to sync Amplitude cohorts with Mailchimp's marketing platform.}
    marketo {Combine Amplitude's analytics with Marketo's in-app messaging, push notifications, and email tools using this integration.}
    marketo_v2 {The Marketo static list destination allows you to export cohorts as a static list into Marketo, which can then be sent to a destination folder or program of your choice.}
    moengage {Amplitude's MoEngage integration enables you to send hyper-targeted behavioral audiences from Amplitude to MoEngage.}
    netcore_cloud {This integration lets you sync Amplitude cohorts with Netcore Cloud's Customer Engagement & Experience Platform.}
    notivize {Use this integration to send audiences from Amplitude to Notivize and drive user engagement.}
    onesignal {With our Amplitude integration, unify your customer data, create audiences, and send user traits to OneSignal in real-time.}
    productboard {Integrating Productboard with Amplitude allows you to filter customer feedback based on cohorts created within Amplitude and categorize the insights into themes that can inform the product roadmap. Product managers can then make better decisions about what to build and who might be most affected when new features are shipped.}
    qualtrics {The Qualtrics cohort export integration enables you to export Amplitude user cohorts into an existing mailing list in your Qualtrics XM directory.}
    sfmc {This integration combines Amplitude's analytics with Salesforce Marketing Cloud, allowing you to export Behavioral Cohorts from Amplitude to Salesforce Marketing Cloud, so you can better engage your users.}
    sfmc_v2 {This integration also combines Amplitude's analytics with Salesforce Marketing Cloud, and it lets you export Behavioral Cohorts from Amplitude to Salesforce Marketing Cloud for more personalized user engagement.}
    segment {The Segment integration enables you to send cohorts from Amplitude to Segment.}
    snapchat_ads {With the Snapchat Ads integration, you can send audiences from Amplitude to Snapchat Ads, allowing you to create more personalized campaigns.}
    split {Amplitude's Split integration lets you export your Amplitude cohorts and use them as segmentation and targeting criteria in Split. From there, you can create splits or feature flags for specific user segments defined by your Amplitude data.}
    statsig {This integration lets you send cohorts from Amplitude to Statsig.}
    tiktok_ads {The TikTok Ads integration enables you to send audiences from Amplitude to TikTok Ads Manager, allowing you to create more personalized campaigns.}
    }

