faqList.answer:
{category, select,
          addon-cancel-subscription-only {No, currently it is not possible to cancel a subscription for an add-on feature while still using the Plus Plan. For now, both subscriptions need to be canceled at the same time.}
          addon-how-to-purchase {Navigate to Settings > Organization Settings > Plans & Billing > Modify your Plan

Add-on features can be purchased when the Plus plan is purchased, or in-app during the term of your Plus plan subscription. The fees for any purchased add-on will automatically be charged to the credit card that is on file for your account in Stripe.}
          addon-subscription-term {Yes. You will be charged a prorated fee for the add-on for the remainder of the initial purchased month/year. After that initial prorated payment, all additional fees for the add-on will be due at the same time as your regularly scheduled payments for the Plus plan.}
          automatic-renewal {Navigate to Settings > Organization Settings > Plans & Billing > Manage Billing to cancel your subscription.

This option is available to the user who originally made the purchase, and all admins in your organization.}
          billing-help {For questions related to billing and invoices, please reach out to <a href="mailto:plusbilling@amplitude.com">plusbilling@amplitude.com</a>.}
          cancellation-policy {You can cancel your subscription at any time before your next renewal period. You will have access to your Plus plan until the end of your current subscription period. <br /><br /> For more information on MTUs and billing, please see the <a href="https://help.amplitude.com/hc/en-us/articles/12217810210331" target='_blank' rel="noopener noreferrer">Help Center article on MTU billing.</a>.}
          mtu-guardrail {To maintain quality service for all customers and protect against unexpected surges, we've incorporated a guardrail of an average of up to 1,000 events per MTU. To illustrate, a customer who purchases 10,000 MTUs can ingest up to 10,000 MTU x 1,000 events = 10M events in aggregate per month. Most customers will never hit this limit. In the event you do go over this limit, each additional 1,000 events (or portion thereof) will be converted to 1 MTU and charged according to the overage fee schedule.}
          over-quota {Overage fees are calculated based on any monthly tracked users (MTU) in excess of the Plus plan volume that you purchased, as of the end of each month. The applicable Overage Fee is determined by your current Plus Plan MTU Tier and is calculated in accordance with the following schedule:}
          over-quota-consumption-based {Overage fees are calculated for any monthly tracked users (MTU) or Events in excess of the Plus plan volume at the end of each month. Overage fees are charged at 1.2x the customer’s per MTU or per Event price (as applicable).}
          plan-differences-v2 {The Growth plan includes everything on Plus, as well as SSO, Campaign Reporting, Journeys, Revenue LTV, Engagement Matrix, Conversion Drivers, A/B Test Analysis, Anomaly Detection, Compass, Personas, Forecasting, Cohort Syncs, Target Metrics, implementation support, and customer success. Customers on Growth will also have the option to purchase the Portfolio, Govern, and Insights add-ons, as well as Audiences and Experiment products.
• Unlimited cohorts
• Cart Analytics
• Conversion drivers
• Forecasting and anomaly detection
• Deeper behavioral insights e.g.Impact Analysis, Engagement Matrix, Personas, etc.
• Custom metrics & templates
• SSO
• Custom data retention
• Onboarding and customer success

Customers on a Growth plan can also purchase the Portfolio, Govern, and Insights add-ons, as well as Amplitude's Audiences and Experiment products.}
          plan-differences-v3 {The Growth plan includes everything in the Plus plan, as well as:
• Unlimited cohorts
• Cart Analytics
• Conversion drivers
• Forecasting and anomaly detection
• Deeper behavioral insights e.g.Impact Analysis, Engagement Matrix, Personas, etc.
• Custom metrics & templates
• SSO
• Custom data retention
• Onboarding and customer success
• Session Replay for web and mobile

Customers on a Growth plan can also purchase the Portfolio, Govern, and Insights add-ons, as well as Amplitude's Audiences and Experiment products. Furthermore, Customers on Growth can customize the number of session replays captured monthly ($)}
          subscription-renewal {Your subscription will automatically renew every 12 months if you are on the annual plan, or the first of every month if you are on the monthly plan.}
          terms-of-service {Amplitude's <a href="{termsOfServiceURL}" target='_blank' rel="noopener noreferrer">Terms of Service</a>, as amended and supplemented by the <a href="{plusPlanTermsURL}" target='_blank' rel="noopener noreferrer">Plus Plan terms</a>, apply.}
        }

